# The host's input path (port/host/input.cpp) with SDL events from ELTALE_INPUT_TEST (a hidden window: tests only):
# TICK = pad reads (about 2 VIs). New Game (Enter), A through the opening (Space; English has more pages), then
# right-drag turns, motion with no button (ignored), the wheel, W to walk (relative to the view), the camera keys
# (Z, PageUp), mouse look on (Tab) with motion and off, motion again (ignored), a middle-click reset, W again.
